\">Do you need an SEO?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEO is an acronym for \"search engine optimization\" or \"search engine optimizer.\" Deciding to hire an SEO is a big decision that can potentially improve your site and save time, but you can also risk damage to your site and reputation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/do-i-need-seo\">Learn More</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|xx-small\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NWsyr-D06Ck\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NWsyr-D06Ck\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:uagb/container {\"block_id\":\"e531b216\",\"isBlockRootParent\":true} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-e531b216 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\"><!-- wp:uagb/container {\"block_id\":\"4e0a589c\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-4e0a589c\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|x-large\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|x-large\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|medium\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"quaternary\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-quaternary-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-large);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-large)\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|xx-small\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Full Site Editing?</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Full Site Editing (FSE) is a feature in WordPress that allows users to visually design and customize their entire website, including the header, footer, and other template parts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-swt-separator-wide-thin-line\",\"backgroundColor\":\"outline\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-outline-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-outline-background-color has-background is-style-swt-separator-wide-thin-line\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|xx-small\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What are some benefits of using Full Site Editing?</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Full Site Editing provides a more user-friendly, streamlined approach to website design and customization. It allows users to see changes in real-time, provides more control over design elements, and enables developers to create more custom blocks and templates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-swt-separator-wide-thin-line\",\"backgroundColor\":\"outline\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-outline-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-outline-background-color has-background is-style-swt-separator-wide-thin-line\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|xx-small\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can I use Full Site Editing on my existing WordPress website?</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, you can use Full Site Editing on an existing WordPress website by installing a compatible theme that supports the feature.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-swt-separator-wide-thin-line\",\"backgroundColor\":\"outline\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-outline-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-outline-background-color has-background is-style-swt-separator-wide-thin-line\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|xx-small\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Do I need to know how to code to use Full Site Editing?</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No, Full Site Editing does not require knowledge of coding or web development. The drag-and-drop interface and pre-designed templates make it easy for users to create a professional-looking website without any coding experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"spectra-one\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary></summary><!-- wp:uagb/sure-forms /--></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->','Blog Home','Displays the latest posts as either the site homepage or as the \"Posts page\" as defined under reading settings. If it exists, the Front Page template overrides this template when posts are shown on the homepage.','inherit','closed','closed','','13-revision-v1','','','2025-11-12 00:34:48','2025-11-12 00:34:48','',13,'https://happytailspawcare.com/?p=317',0,'revision','',0),
