 we aren\'t even aware of what resources are available to us or what value they can provide for the cost.&nbsp; We match services from highly rated pet care providers in your neighborhood to your calendar, budget, and lifestyle.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|primary\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|small\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-link-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--small);font-style:normal;font-weight:500\"><a href=\"https://happytailspawcare.com/learn-more/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"686\">Learn More</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|x-small\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|medium\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-small);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--medium)\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"letterSpacing\":\"2px\"}},\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\" style=\"letter-spacing:2px\">02</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading\",\"textColor\":\"heading\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-heading-color has-text-color\">Accurate and rich data</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The curated list you receive, should remind the home media consumer of yesteryear\'s\' cable television. Would you prefer a movie on HBO or browse for hours to find the next Netflix entertainment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|primary\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|small\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-link-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--small);font-style:normal;font-weight:500\"><a href=\"https://happytailspawcare.com/learn-more/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"686\">Learn More</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1040,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"8px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://happytailspawcare.com/wp-content/themes/spectra-one/assets/image/content-2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1040\" style=\"border-radius:8px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|x-large\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|x-large\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|medium\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-large);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-large)\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|x-small\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-small)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 c